## 🤔 Why Not Use Big UI Libraries?

| Other Libraries | Simp Design Library |
| --------------- | ------------------- |
| Heavy           | Lightweight         |
| Complex         | Simple              |
| Setup required  | No setup            |
| Less flexible   | Fully customizable  |

